{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, how're you doing? I'm sorry about Max. Losing a pet is tough. Some friends from church and I went camping last weekend - it was a blast! Just something nice to take my mind off things. Anything fun in your life lately?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-b518086a85d54cd05f5be446", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:52:40.663815+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b518086a85d54cd05f5be446", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b518086a85d54cd05f5be446", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, thanks for your kind words. It's still tough, but I'm finding some comfort in the good memories. Wow, your camping trip sounds awesome! I went on a mountaineering trip last week with some workmates. It was great and helped clear my head. Anything else cool happening in your life?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-98d7ce8736b79ddcd37b0588", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:52:44.786724+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "98d7ce8736b79ddcd37b0588", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "98d7ce8736b79ddcd37b0588", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Glad you're finding comfort, John. That mountaineering trip sounds amazing. Did you reach the summit? When I was younger, my family and I went on a road trip to Oregon."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-7875f819a8ef0307282a9bf0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:52:48.924321+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7875f819a8ef0307282a9bf0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7875f819a8ef0307282a9bf0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! Yeah, we made it to the top and the view was stunning. It was tough but awesome. Your family trip must have been great too, right? What was the prettiest spot?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-ac7e475ff640fd674a7c5ba4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:52:53.054838+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ac7e475ff640fd674a7c5ba4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ac7e475ff640fd674a7c5ba4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hiking to the top and seeing this was awesome! Breath-taking."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-3249f5b7a8398385db33dd75", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:52:57.175815+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3249f5b7a8398385db33dd75", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3249f5b7a8398385db33dd75", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! That waterfall and bridge look amazing! What a view. How was it being there?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-3c677011d8b9e6a478f52209", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:01.343787+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3c677011d8b9e6a478f52209", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3c677011d8b9e6a478f52209", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I felt like I was in a fairy tale! The water sounded so calming and the surroundings were beautiful. It was truly magical!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-d001a148b9016f5543513b07", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:05.446710+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d001a148b9016f5543513b07", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d001a148b9016f5543513b07", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria, that sounds awesome! It seems like nature has a way of calming us down, huh?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-48ce9af8ab5dd84812d4a10f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:09.556234+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "48ce9af8ab5dd84812d4a10f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "48ce9af8ab5dd84812d4a10f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, it's like a natural soul-soother when things get tough."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-13684ddde9db0bddf361d781", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:13.661081+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "13684ddde9db0bddf361d781", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "13684ddde9db0bddf361d781", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, for sure. It's like a reset button, you know? Have you ever gone camping or mountain climbing before?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-468ac16b9ccfa58b1c926d8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:17.772082+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "468ac16b9ccfa58b1c926d8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "468ac16b9ccfa58b1c926d8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I've gone camping a few times but never tried mountain climbing. Sounds thrilling though! Have you been camping before?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-e1e6a20331de7b0eb2179438", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:21.915670+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e1e6a20331de7b0eb2179438", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e1e6a20331de7b0eb2179438", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, plenty of times. It's an awesome way to get away from it all and be at one with nature. I love how uncomplicated it is."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-6352775e45c11dd89a8d0168", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:26.075687+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6352775e45c11dd89a8d0168", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6352775e45c11dd89a8d0168", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah John, I get it. Being in nature helps us take a break from life's craziness and recognize what truly matters."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-966eaa24f9fa51a8883e648f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:30.210196+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "966eaa24f9fa51a8883e648f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "966eaa24f9fa51a8883e648f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria. It's important to appreciate the small things and find moments of peace amidst chaos. Nature really helps with that. How about you? How do you find peaceful moments?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-7e117288790a13b62410b256", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:34.342977+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7e117288790a13b62410b256", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7e117288790a13b62410b256", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Finding my Zen is a mix of things - a moment to myself plus favorite tunes is usually enough. I also enjoy aerial yoga, it's a great way to switch off and focus on my body."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-868f452c7028c55c2ca79b9d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:38.461039+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "868f452c7028c55c2ca79b9d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "868f452c7028c55c2ca79b9d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool, Maria! Glad you found something that gives you some peace. Do you have a favorite yoga pose?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-797758322fc90fa1d1de1dad", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:42.565754+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "797758322fc90fa1d1de1dad", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "797758322fc90fa1d1de1dad", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! It's tough to pick just one, but I really enjoy the upside-down poses. They make me feel free and light."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-6e7f72d9d048ecb19c5f525f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:46.672830+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e7f72d9d048ecb19c5f525f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e7f72d9d048ecb19c5f525f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria, that sounds awesome! I can imagine that must be challenging, but it's great to see you embracing them. Keep up the amazing work!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-07ca909bb073c371282b1b0b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:50.818044+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "07ca909bb073c371282b1b0b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "07ca909bb073c371282b1b0b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! It can be tough, but aerial yoga is totally worth it. I love the freedom and connection it brings. Appreciate your support!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-a8787721cd152df402960bd1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:54.935133+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a8787721cd152df402960bd1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a8787721cd152df402960bd1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yes, Maria! I'm here for you. Glad you found something that makes you happy. This is what makes me smile. Keep shining!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-84443b1ac729dd4dc6d9f2d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:53:59.084164+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "84443b1ac729dd4dc6d9f2d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "84443b1ac729dd4dc6d9f2d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow! Looks like you had fun - what happened there?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-079ae5d3392119d14663e4ad", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:54:03.209529+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "079ae5d3392119d14663e4ad", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "079ae5d3392119d14663e4ad", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It was an awesome day at the park with my family. The kids had a lot of fun on the playground, and we had some really nice family time."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-33a3fdc7321f00ec6117f913", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:54:07.321447+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "33a3fdc7321f00ec6117f913", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "33a3fdc7321f00ec6117f913", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, that's great to hear, John! Cherish those family time moments!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_18-e8c8e7a6a3c6f103dac6e2c9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:54:11.458961+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8c8e7a6a3c6f103dac6e2c9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8c8e7a6a3c6f103dac6e2c9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
